note tools/estimation/test_est_tools.om -- Test suite for est_replay, est_fit,
note and est_eval (protocol v1 and v2) in pure seeded OM-2.
note Composed after: est_defs.om est_math.om est_types.om est_kf.om est_mix.om
note est_pred.om est_v4.om est_replay.om.
